Se7en is a crime, mystery, thriller film directed by David Fincher.

3
00:12:42,000 --> 00:12:48,000
Two homicide detectives are on a desperate hunt for a serial killer whose crimes are based on the "seven deadly sins"
in this dark and haunting film that takes viewers from the tortured remains of one victim to the next.

4
